DESCRIPTION:Come join the Reynold’s High school drama and stagecraft student in this magical Shakespearan comedy with a modern twist.  Fun for everyone! Showtimes are: May 7\, 8\, 14\, 15\, 16 at 7 pm and May 10 and 17 at 2 pm \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
