SUMMARY:Portland Pickles All-Stars Open Tryouts + Lents Park Open House
DESCRIPTION:The Portland Pickles All-Stars will host open tryouts at Walker Stadium for the first time\, offering a unique opportunity to watch players compete for roster spots ahead of the summer season. \nThis lively\, family-friendly event blends real on-field competition with the fun\, community-driven atmosphere the Pickles are known for. Spectators can enjoy the excitement of live tryouts while getting a preview of the upcoming season. \nThe evening is part of a larger Lents Park Open House\, featuring facility tours\, player meet-and-greets\, and previews of the Pickles\, Bangers\, and Cherry Bombs. \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/portland-pickles-all-stars-open-tryouts-lents-park-open-house/
LOCATION:Walker Stadium\, 4727 SE 92nd Ave\, Portland\, O\, 97266\, United States
CATEGORIES:Family Fun,Kids Calendar,Outdoor,Sports
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/Party-copy-2.png
END:VEVENT
