SUMMARY:Camerata Spring Concert
DESCRIPTION:PYP’s Camerata ensemble will spotlight seldom-heard voices in classical music including William Boyce\, Edward Elgar and Ruth Gipps. This concert is an ideal introduction to classical msuic for new audiences that will also engage seasoned concertgoers. Recommended for ages 8+. \n 
